title INC000A1F3C7D | Azure support service API authentication failures

Incident Overview
Customer-facing APIs became unavailable after several AKS worker nodes stopped reporting healthy status. Replacement capacity could not be scheduled quickly enough, leaving ingress with too few healthy application instances.

Environment: Production
Cloud: Azure
Affected service: AKS / ingress-nginx / customer-api
Customer impact: Requests to /api/v1/orders and /api/v1/customers intermittently return HTTP 503 while healthy capacity is restored.

